* LayerZero V2
** EndpointV2
*** One per chain, identified by an eid
*** Immutable, not proxied
*** Owner: register libraries, set defaults
*** Nonces, payload hashes, compose queue
** Security stack per OApp and pathway
*** Send / receive library (ULN302)
*** DVNs: X required + Y of N optional
*** Block confirmations
*** Executor
*** Delegate sets the configuration
** Message lifecycle
*** quote, send, PacketSent
*** DVN verify, commitVerification
*** Endpoint verify, lzReceive
*** lzCompose as a second transaction
** Nonces and recovery
*** Unordered by default, no gaps
*** skip, clear, nilify, burn
** Options and fees
*** TYPE_3 options, enforced options
*** DVN + executor + treasury fees
** Defaults are dangerous
*** Unset fields follow the endpoint owner
*** Pin libraries, DVNs, confirmations
** OApp and OFT
*** peers per eid
*** Shared decimals and dust
*** OFT burn/mint, adapter lock/unlock
** lzRead
*** Read channel, DVNs run the query
